<text font-family="sans-serif" fill="black" x="230" y="230"
      font-size="16px" font-weight="bold">PC 24.012 Trapezium</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="248">Wolkonsky, Alexandre: Wolkonsky Faceting Designs, </text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="266">Jun 95, p30.   Six of these designs combine with a</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="284">hexagonal center stone to make a composite(see 28.153)</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black"><tspan x="230" y="302">Angles for R.I. = 1.760</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="320">31 facets + 4 girdles</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="338">1-fold, mirror-image symmetry; 96 index</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="356">L/W = 2.401  T/W = 1.556  U/W = 0.604</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="374">P/W = 0.712 C/W = 0.174</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="392">Vol/W&#179; = 0.795</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="410">pc24012.asc</tspan>
